intact_host_organism_test.xml: a cut of IntAct PSI-MI 2.5 XML for PsiConverterTest.testHostOrganism
and testLicence.

Source:    https://ftp.ebi.ac.uk/pub/databases/intact/current/psi25/species/human.zip
           (member human_38.xml, third <entry>), file Last-Modified 2026-10-24,
           <source releaseDate="2026-10-24+01:00">, zip sha256
           d8b69fb7a2b4c1ca668c153e8e942f5a5fe322a3c8e5308a1cdaee89f95b9e55, copy of 18 Nov 2026
Licence:   CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ (IntAct, EMBL-EBI; see
           https://www.ebi.ac.uk/intact/about#license_privacy)

Kept verbatim: the entrySet start tag, the entry's <source>, two experimentDescriptions
(wang-2011-4, host ncbiTaxId -1 "In vitro"; wang-2011-5, host 9606 "Homo sapiens HEK293T
embryonic kidney cell"), the interaction casp10-riok3 of each, and their two interactors (CASP10,
RIOK3). In the second interaction the participants carry their own hostOrganismList
("Escherichia coli (strain K12)", "Homo sapiens"), which must not replace the experiment's host.
Everything else in the entry is left out.
